* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

# A .docx is a zip of XML. `text=auto` happened to guess binary for the three in
# docs/deliverables, but guessing is the whole problem: one whose bytes read as
# text would have its line endings rewritten on checkout and open as corrupt.
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
.styleci.yml export-ignore
